			"widgets_values":[
				"### 第一部分：创意内容描述 (Creative Content Brief)\n\n| 标题 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **项目名称** | 保温杯广告分镜图 |\n| **分镜总格数** | 12格 (3x4布局) |\n| **总体风格** | 黑白、高对比度、手绘线稿 |\n\n**【分镜图内容列表 (Shot List)】**\n\n| 编号 | 画面描述 (Visual/Action) | 镜头/景别 (Shot Type) | 旁白/对话/文字 (Narration/Text) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 清晨，桌上放着保温杯，阳光透过窗户洒在杯子上，冒着热气。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | “从清晨开始，温暖一天。” |\n| 2 | 白领在办公室打开保温杯，喝一口热咖啡，神情放松。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “工作间隙，保持热饮温度。” |\n| 3 | 户外远足，登山者从背包里拿出保温杯，喝水解渴。背景是山景。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | “无论户外，冷热随行。” |\n| 4 | 家庭聚会，桌上摆满食物，保温杯静置一旁，孩子开心地喝水。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “适合全家使用，温暖分享。” |\n| 5 | 晚上加班，保温杯放在桌子上，旁边是电脑，杯子冒出热气。 | 特写 (Close-up) | “陪伴每一个加班的夜晚。” |\n| 6 | 冬日雪景中，行人手持保温杯，喝热饮，雪花飘落。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “寒冬里，带给你温暖。” |\n| 7 | 夏日沙滩，女性手持保温杯，喝冰水，背景是大海和阳光。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | “炎夏亦可享受冰凉。” |\n| 8 | 保温杯放在车内杯架上，驾驶员伸手取杯，喝水。 | 特写 (Close-up) | “车内长途旅行，随时解渴。” |\n| 9 | 保温杯内部结构剖析图，显示真空层和保温效果。 | 技术图解 (Diagram Shot) | “24小时长效保温保冷。” |\n| 10 | 时间轴展示：6小时后，12小时后，24小时后，保温效果对比图。 | 技术图解 (Diagram Shot) | “热饮始终保持温度。” |\n| 11 | 保温杯与不同场景的对比拼图：办公桌、户外、车内。 | 拼接画面 (Split Screen) | “适应任何场景。” |\n| 12 | 纯白背景，保温杯静置中央，旁边是品牌Logo和标语。 | 特写 (Close-up) | “24小时长效，温暖你的生活。” |\n\n---\n\n### 第二部分：生成的黑白分镜图 (Generated Storyboard)\n\n**【提示生成指令 (Prompt for Image Generation)】**：\n\n\"Create a 12-frame storyboard in a 3x4 layout, illustrating a black-and-white ink sketch style advertisement for a vacuum flask. Each frame should depict the following scenes with high contrast and dynamic line art:  \n1. Morning scene with the flask on a table under sunlight, steam rising.  \n2. Office setting where a professional drinks coffee from the flask.  \n3. Outdoor hiking with a flask in hand against a mountain backdrop.  \n4. Family gathering with the flask on a table and a child drinking water.  \n5. Nighttime work desk with a flask steaming next to a laptop.  \n6. Winter snow scene with a person drinking from the flask.  \n7. Summer beach scene with a flask and ocean background.  \n8. Flask in a car cup holder, driver reaching for it.  \n9. Internal technical diagram of the vacuum flask showing insulation layers.  \n10. Timeline comparison of temperature retention over 6, 12, and 24 hours.  \n11. Split-screen showing flask used in office, outdoors, and car.  \n12. Final frame with the flask on a white background, brand logo, and tagline ‘24-hour insulation, warm your life.’  \nMaintain consistent black-and-white sketch style with clean lines and detailed shading.\""
			],
